---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout basePath="" title="How It Works | Ask Astro Raja">

  <!-- PAGE HEADER -->
  <section class="pt-32 pb-16 px-4 bg-brand-light-bg text-center border-b border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
      <p class="text-brand-saffron font-bold tracking-[0.2em] uppercase mb-6 text-sm md:text-base">
        The Methodology
      </p>
      <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-6xl font-extrabold text-brand-navy mb-6 tracking-tight">This is not another astrology report.</h1>
      <p class="text-lg md:text-xl text-brand-text leading-relaxed font-medium">
        We don't do predictions. We don't do generic horoscopes. We decode the behavioral patterns keeping you stuck and give you the system to break them.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE SHIFT (MIRROR, MAP, MANUAL) -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 max-w-6xl mx-auto">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
      
      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-saffron/5 rounded-bl-full -mr-10 -mt-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110"></div>
        <div class="text-4xl mb-6 text-brand-saffron-dark font-serif italic">01.</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">The Mirror</h3>
        <p class="text-brand-text leading-relaxed">
          We show you the exact behavioral loop that's been running your life — the cycle you can't see because you're inside it. You'll see your perfectionism, your self-doubt, and your relationship dynamics laid out in uncomfortable honesty.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-brand-navy border border-brand-navy-light p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-lg relative overflow-hidden group text-white">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-saffron/10 rounded-bl-full -mr-10 -mt-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110"></div>
        <div class="text-4xl mb-6 text-brand-saffron font-serif italic">02.</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mb-4">The Map</h3>
        <p class="text-slate-300 leading-relaxed">
          We identify exactly where you are missing the mark. We map out the blind spots, the triggers, and the daily habits that feel normal to you but are quietly destroying your progress and draining your energy.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white border border-brand-border p-10 rounded-3xl shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow relative overflow-hidden group">
        <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-32 h-32 bg-brand-saffron/5 rounded-bl-full -mr-10 -mt-10 transition-transform group-hover:scale-110"></div>
        <div class="text-4xl mb-6 text-brand-saffron-dark font-serif italic">03.</div>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-4">The Manual</h3>
        <p class="text-brand-text leading-relaxed">
          Awareness is useless without action. We give you a complete daily system — a custom morning routine, mindset rules, an identity shift framework, and a checklist customized strictly to YOUR specific psychology.
        </p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- THE PROCESS -->
  <section class="py-24 px-4 bg-slate-50 border-t border-brand-border">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
      <div class="text-center mb-16">
        <div class="text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold tracking-widest uppercase mb-4 text-sm">How It Works</div>
        <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold text-brand-navy mb-6">Four steps to <span class="text-brand-saffron italic">rewrite your code</span></h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-12 relative before:absolute before:inset-0 before:ml-6 before:-translate-x-px md:before:mx-auto md:before:translate-x-0 before:h-full before:w-0.5 before:bg-gradient-to-b before:from-transparent before:via-brand-border before:to-transparent">
        
        <!-- Step 1 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group is-active">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-white bg-brand-saffron text-white font-bold shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 shadow-md z-10">
            1
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-xl mb-2">Provide Your Inputs</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text text-sm">Take 3 minutes to answer a few simple questions about your current struggles and enter your base profile (Raasi/Lagnam/Nakshatra).</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        
        <!-- Step 2 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-brand-light-bg bg-white text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 shadow-sm z-10">
            2
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-xl mb-2">System Analysis</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text text-sm">Our engine maps your unique behavioral blueprint against thousands of ancient psychological profiles to identify your exact operating system.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 3 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-brand-light-bg bg-white text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 shadow-sm z-10">
            3
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-xl mb-2">Receive Your Manual</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text text-sm">Get your personalized transformation report. It contains your diagnosis, your blind spots, and your custom daily plan.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Step 4 -->
        <div class="relative flex items-center justify-between md:justify-normal md:odd:flex-row-reverse group">
          <div class="flex items-center justify-center w-12 h-12 rounded-full border-4 border-brand-light-bg bg-white text-brand-saffron-dark font-bold shrink-0 md:order-1 md:group-odd:-translate-x-1/2 md:group-even:translate-x-1/2 shadow-sm z-10">
            4
          </div>
          <div class="w-[calc(100%-4rem)] md:w-[calc(50%-3rem)] bg-white p-6 rounded-2xl border border-brand-border shadow-sm">
            <h3 class="font-bold text-brand-navy text-xl mb-2">Execute for 90 Days</h3>
            <p class="text-brand-text text-sm">Follow the daily system. Read your 10 truths every morning. Actively break the pattern. Watch your reality shift.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="text-center mt-16">
        <a href="/get-reading" class="px-8 py-4 bg-brand-navy text-white rounded-xl font-bold text-lg hover:bg-brand-purple transition-colors shadow-lg">
          Start Step 1 Now
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
